e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZsSYD6LTbwQ7kNvwGFC9LN&_nc_oc=Adr45shnb346QzMsqJCmB9Yllb3EegRLpKbtcbZQW3WPp79tHlx5u7qhbGD3OUs3og8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC3PCwUE5Q5OAOHHJI5dcgSFVabMiyIyudDobRXecSclw&oe=6A4A7379"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hlekoNjShc8Q7kNvwH-pcCc&_nc_oc=AdomEZGTjVR82_cej1bVxj6jSAyIXHSDvLi6O2Z0xjzn2LRv8n--P2xQrytzPmfZJok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAGc8ukwlCisekw-aJp71_C7RcbHd72jdhZMJaNnOpgqA&oe=6A4A8313"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5cmXlrl49c4Q7kNvwHpDGZl&_nc_oc=Adr2ULyGUnJPcD3sSQHqUZGoBYFCzTPcOJuHWlstBh8V1ptyfdg2-sA8_LqI1cNeDuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBoDBxBw7S3SA8m0T93Ui6lFspSPZNNRgWlXTACvq_8WQ&oe=6A4A567B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=exh7jYwBuUEQ7kNvwHcbEzF&_nc_oc=AdrorYKWDpNnDTkqkot7usuwflKcHH-Vlbj1Iv8em9gpo66cIhZBry1ZwQJgIPwRAp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAee2mYV8ut0HDXmdFXUjkvUUsw1MBLZfpU0d5lTUVj8Q&oe=6A4A57CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kl6vhwbpuhgQ7kNvwESWnjd&_nc_oc=AdplMA6bQeENltuEtdc8UNyCaFa-bg2-t-_eUIsUIjsy37z__jNT_4P1fn6p3aPdCis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC-ZSZvzfot7QJQUBxBmPCFZz403sPU1t8zeeSvK-TEEA&oe=6A4A793E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se